WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.570
This is a weird, but true.

2
00:00:01.570 --> 00:00:04.570
A scandal has rocked the world of award-winning

3
00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:05.580
nature photography.

4
00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:07.320
You wouldn't think there'd be a scandal

5
00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.420
in the world of nature photography.

6
00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:10.290
True story.

7
00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:14.610
There is a Brazilian photographer named Marcio Cabral.

8
00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:17.350
Took this stunning photo of an anteater

9
00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:20.460
approaching a glowing termite mound at night.

10
00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:21.690
This is a photo that he took.

11
00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:22.523
Isn't that gorgeous?

12
00:00:22.523 --> 00:00:24.290
You see the anteater moving in.

13
00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:25.240
Well, guess what?

14
00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:27.650
The photo's been hanging in a British museum

15
00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.340
because people revere it.

16
00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:31.440
Until they just discovered Cabral had used

17
00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:35.260
a stuffed anteater to take the photo.

18
00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:36.093
Yes!

19
00:00:36.093 --> 00:00:38.330
And this is a huge scandal in the world of photography.

20
00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:40.780
Now they're starting to question the authenticity

21
00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:43.510
of other famous photos Cabral has taken.

22
00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:46.110
There's this photo of a wild mustang standing proudly

23
00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:46.943
in the wilderness.

24
00:00:46.943 --> 00:00:48.411
People are worried about it.

25
00:00:48.411 --> 00:00:50.110
(audience laughter)

26
00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:51.277
Yeah, there is

27
00:00:53.126 --> 00:00:55.990
worry about that one, yeah.

28
00:00:55.990 --> 00:00:57.560
There's this photo of a timber wolf swimming

29
00:00:57.560 --> 00:00:58.980
across a swollen stream.

30
00:00:58.980 --> 00:01:00.165
Look at that wolf go!

31
00:01:00.165 --> 00:01:02.090
(audience laughter)

32
00:01:02.090 --> 00:01:04.730
There's this dramatic photo of a shark

33
00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:05.620
attacking a boat.

34
00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:07.441
Something didn't seem right!

35
00:01:07.441 --> 00:01:08.450
(audience laughter)

36
00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:11.193
There's this flock of flamingos walking in the snow.

37
00:01:12.674 --> 00:01:13.950
(audience cheer)

38
00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:15.360
Yeah.

39
00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:17.780
And finally, this photo of a group of aggressive

40
00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:20.350
Galapagos tortoises fighting over some food.

41
00:01:20.350 --> 00:01:21.750
People are worried about it.

42
00:01:22.634 --> 00:01:25.354
(audience cheering and clapping)

43
00:01:25.354 --> 00:01:27.437
(laughs)

